{"name":"The Constant Bell","slug":"glyph-constant-bell","blurb":"On the designate street, Bram carries the bell toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Constant. Click the bell and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Constant Bell.","seal":"6c3753c185fefee1e9b9e8b71056a0e81e572343674a59a5b5f6268581d4a43c"}
